    // real-JDK bodies drive `sun.text.normalizer` off ICU normalization data
    // (`jdk.localedata`-adjacent tables) that CratonVM doesn't surface, so they
    // return garbage (e.g. `normalize("ï", NFD)` yields six U+0226 chars).
